  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funds to pilot and evaluate innovative projects for the economic empowerment of adolescent girls in the Democratic Republic of Congo (DRC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Funds to pilot and evaluate innovative projects for the economic empowerment of adolescent girls in the Democratic Republic of Congo (DRC) is a component of La Pepiniere: Programme for adolescent girls in the Democratic Republic of Congo reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;693,670. It works in the following sector(s): Women&apos;s rights organisations and movements, and government institutions, Basic life skills for adults, Environmental policy and administrative management, Family planning.</narrative>
  </description>
